SUMMARY:Min Jibalina: Resistance From Algeria's Mountains to the Masses -
  by ELDV for Palestine
LOCATION:Available upon registration (downtown)
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://events.humanitix.com/min-jibalina-resistance-from-algeria-s-mount
 ains-to-the-masses\n\nHosted by ELDV for Palestine
  (https://www.instagram.com/eldv4palestine/)\n\nJoin ELDV and SPFY on
  Algeria’s Independence Day to mark 64 years of freedom\, and reflect on
  the enduring cost of liberation and the long arc of decolonial struggle.
  Learn how the Algerian struggle succeeded and consider what it means to
  sustain decolonial resistance in the present.
END:VEVENT
