SUMMARY:Rooted in Resilience: How Rural Development Drives Poverty
  Eradication\, Climate Action\, and Shared Prosperity - by Sustainable
  Community Aid Network
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/_LBpA9vyRBCEXkOVAlPNOg#/registra
 tion\n\nHosted by Sustainable Community Aid Network
  (https://www.s-can.org/)\n\nThis webinar will examine how rural
  development strategies — including sustainable agriculture\, local food
  systems\, renewable energy\, infrastructure investment\, and
  community-led development — can serve as powerful tools for poverty
  reduction and climate resilience. It will also highlight practical\,
  place-based solutions for empowering rural communities and building more
  equitable systems.
END:VEVENT
